## UserGate NGFW X10

It's a compact hardware NGFW built for industrial networks (SCADA) and harsh sites: fanless passive cooling, DIN-rail mounting, **−40 to +60 °C** operating range, IP30, 24 W consumption with an external 12 V PSU (up to two AC/DC or DC/DC).

Hardware: ARM 4-core 1.8 GHz, 16 GB DDR4, 128 GB SSD, 6× RJ-45 (one bypass pair), 1× SFP+, no extra NIC slots. Throughput at NGFW mode (L7 + IPS + content filtering) is **40 Mbps on EMIX**, while L4 reaches 1800 Mbps — so size it for the deep-inspection profile, not the raw firewall figure.

